  ["Armor, all stats and resistances buff, doesn't stack with Mark of the Wild"] = "護甲、全屬性和抗性增益，不與野性印記疊加",
  ["Better disenchanting"] = "更好的分解",
  ["{i:273103:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Arcane Salvager} Dropped by: {n:246020::Shade of the Archmage} in the City of Dalaran"] = "{i:273103:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Arcane Salvager} 掉落自：達拉然城的 {n:246020::Shade of the Archmage}",
  ["An Arcane Forge, needed for some Enchanting recipes"] = "一座秘法熔爐，部分附魔配方需要",
  ["{i:273116:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Arcane Forge} Dropped by: {n:261809::Nanaya} in Kalimdor"] = "{i:273116:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Arcane Forge} 掉落自：卡林多的 {n:261809::Nanaya}",
  ["Summons the {n:242498::Reagent Bot}, a vendor with class reagents and profession supplies for everyone at the camp"] = "召喚 {n:242498::Reagent Bot}，一個為營地所有人提供職業材料和專業用品的商人",
  ["Repairs for everyone at the camp"] = "為營地所有人修理裝備",
  ["{i:273092:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Repair Bot} Dropped by: {n:643::Sneed} in The Deadmines"] = "{i:273092:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Repair Bot} 掉落自：死亡礦坑的 {n:643::Sneed}",
  ["An Anarchist's Workbench, needed for some Engineering recipes"] = "一張無政府主義者工作台，部分工程學配方需要",
  ["{i:273117:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Anarchist's Workbench} Dropped by: {n:11058::Ezra Grimm} in Stratholme"] = "{i:273117:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Anarchist's Workbench} 掉落自：斯坦索姆的 {n:11058::Ezra Grimm}",
  ["Rested experience up to 5% of a level, once an hour (a debuff blocks it until then)"] = "休息經驗值，最多一個等級的 5%，每小時一次（在那之前會有減益效果阻止）",
  ["A Tanning Rack, needed for many Leatherworking recipes"] = "一座製革架，許多製皮配方需要",
  ["{i:273096:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Tanning Rack} Dropped by: {n:3886::Razorclaw the Butcher} in Shadowfang Keep"] = "{i:273096:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Tanning Rack} 掉落自：影牙城堡的 {n:3886::Razorclaw the Butcher}",
  ["A Sewing Machine, needed for many Leatherworking recipes"] = "一台縫紉機，許多製皮配方需要",
  ["{i:273121:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Sewing Machine} Dropped by: {n:10432::Vectus} in Scholomance"] = "{i:273121:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Sewing Machine} 掉落自：通靈學院的 {n:10432::Vectus}",
  ["Spirit buff for players of your faction, doesn't stack with Divine Spirit. Horde and Alliance each have their own banner"] = "為你陣營的玩家提供精神增益，不與神聖之靈疊加。部落和聯盟各有自己的旗幟",
  ["A Spinning Wheel, needed for many Tailoring recipes"] = "一台紡車，許多裁縫配方需要",
  ["{i:273099:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Spinning Wheel} Dropped by: {n:246017::Unstable Sentinel} in the City of Dalaran"] = "{i:273099:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Spinning Wheel} 掉落自：達拉然城的 {n:246017::Unstable Sentinel}",
  ["A Loom, needed for many Tailoring recipes"] = "一台織布機，許多裁縫配方需要",
  ["{i:273124:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Loom} Dropped by: {n:10436::Baroness Anastari} in Stratholme"] = "{i:273124:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Loom} 掉落自：斯坦索姆的 {n:10436::Baroness Anastari}",
  ["Intellect buff, doesn't stack with Arcane Intellect"] = "智力增益，不與秘法智力疊加",
  ["A Greenhouse that grows herbs from seeds you plant"] = "一座溫室，可以用你種下的種子種出草藥",
  ["{i:273106:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Greenhouse} Dropped by: {n:260325::Shadetooth} in Excavation Site: Wetlands"] = "{i:273106:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Greenhouse} 掉落自：挖掘場：濕地的 {n:260325::Shadetooth}",
  ["A Seed Hybridizer that multiplies seeds or combines them into rarer ones"] = "一台種子混種器，可以繁殖種子或把它們合成為更稀有的種子",
  ["Melee Attack Power buff, doesn't stack with Blessing of Might"] = "近戰攻擊強度增益，不與力量祝福疊加",
  ["Spawns a common mining node over time, and gives the Lodestone buff too"] = "會隨時間生成一個普通礦點，同時也提供磁石增益",
  ["{i:273097:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Rock Garden} Dropped by: {n:260326::Relic Guardian} in Excavation Site: Wetlands"] = "{i:273097:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Rock Garden} 掉落自：挖掘場：濕地的 {n:260326::Relic Guardian}",
  ["A Molten Foundry, needed for Smelt Heavy Thorium"] = "一座熔岩鑄造廠，熔煉重型瑟銀需要",
  ["{i:273122:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Molten Foundry} Dropped by: {n:9156::Ambassador Flamelash} in Blackrock Depths"] = "{i:273122:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Molten Foundry} 掉落自：黑石深淵的 {n:9156::Ambassador Flamelash}",
  ["+2% crit chance, doesn't stack with Moonkin Aura"] = "+2% 致命一擊機率，不與梟獸光環疊加",
  ["A book anyone can read to learn Track Beasts"] = "一本任何人都能閱讀並學會追蹤野獸的書",
  ["{i:273098:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Field Guide} Dropped by: {n:3671::Lady Anacondra} in Wailing Caverns"] = "{i:273098:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Field Guide} 掉落自：哀嚎洞穴的 {n:3671::Lady Anacondra}",
  ["A workbench with 1 trap"] = "一張附 1 個陷阱的工作台",
  ["{i:273109:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Trapper's Workbench} Dropped by: {n:10430::The Beast} in Upper Blackrock Spire and {n:3974::Houndmaster Loksey} in Scarlet Monastery"] = "{i:273109:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Trapper's Workbench} 掉落自：黑石塔上層的 {n:10430::The Beast} 和血色修道院的 {n:3974::Houndmaster Loksey}",
  ["Cooking has no tier 1 camp item, its first one is the campfire (see How to Make a Campfire above)."] = "烹飪沒有第 1 階露營物品，它的第一個就是營火（見上方「如何製作營火」）。",
  ["Stamina food for everyone at the camp"] = "為營地所有人提供耐力食物",
  ["{i:273102:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Cookie's Feast} Dropped by: {n:645::Cookie} in The Deadmines"] = "{i:273102:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Cookie's Feast} 掉落自：死亡礦坑的 {n:645::Cookie}",
  ["An Iron Oven, needed for the most advanced Cooking recipes"] = "一座鐵爐，最高階的烹飪配方需要",
  ["{i:273115:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Iron Oven} Dropped by: {n:9736::Quartermaster Zigris} in Lower Blackrock Spire"] = "{i:273115:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Iron Oven} 掉落自：黑石塔下層的 {n:9736::Quartermaster Zigris}",
  ["Stamina buff, doesn't stack with Power Word: Fortitude"] = "耐力增益，不與真言術：韌疊加",
  ["Healing potions and anti-venom"] = "治療藥水和抗毒劑",
  ["{i:273105:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Toxin Study} Dropped by: {n:4278::Commander Springvale} in Shadowfang Keep"] = "{i:273105:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Toxin Study} 掉落自：影牙城堡的 {n:4278::Commander Springvale}",
  ["Healing potions and poultices"] = "治療藥水和藥膏",
  ["{i:273118:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Plague Doctor's Laboratory} Dropped by: {n:11261::Doctor Theolen Krastinov} in Scholomance"] = "{i:273118:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Plague Doctor's Laboratory} 掉落自：通靈學院的 {n:11261::Doctor Theolen Krastinov}",
  ["+8% all stats, doesn't stack with Blessing of Kings"] = "+8% 全屬性，不與王者祝福疊加",
  ["Uncommon fish for 1 hour and Fishing lures"] = "1 小時的優秀魚類和釣魚魚餌",
  ["{i:273141:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Fishing Rack} Dropped by: {n:6243::Gelihast} in Blackfathom Deeps"] = "{i:273141:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Fishing Rack} 掉落自：黑暗深淵的 {n:6243::Gelihast}",
  ["Rare fish for 1 hour and Fishing lures"] = "1 小時的精良魚類和釣魚魚餌",
  ["{i:273119:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Fishing Hut} Dropped by: {n:5710::Jammal'an the Prophet} in the Sunken Temple"] = "{i:273119:inv_garrison_blueprints3:Blueprint: Fishing Hut} 掉落自：沉沒的神廟的 {n:5710::Jammal'an the Prophet}",
  ["Crafting Stations: Tanning Rack, Loom and More"] = "製作設施：製革架、織布機等",
  ["A lot of recipes in WoW Forever need a crafting station nearby, like a Tanning Rack, a Spinning Wheel or a Loom. {b}I haven't found any of them out in the world{/b}, they only come from camps, so for a lot of higher level crafting you need a camp. The easiest way is a camp that already has the station, anyone at the fire can use it."] = "WoW Forever 中很多配方都需要附近有製作設施，例如製革架、紡車或織布機。{b}我在野外從沒找到過任何一個{/b}，它們只來自營地，所以許多高等級製作都需要營地。最簡單的方法是找一個已經有該設施的營地，營火旁的任何人都可以使用。",
  ["To place one yourself:"] = "要自己放置一個：",
  ["Get your profession to the skill in the table below."] = "把你的專業練到下表中的技能。",
  ["Get the station's Blueprint and learn it. The table shows where it drops, if we know it."] = "取得該設施的藍圖並學會。表格會列出它的掉落來源（如果已知）。",
  ["Craft the station, put down a campfire and use the station from your bags next to it."] = "製作設施，放下營火，然後在旁邊從背包使用該設施。",
  ["Station"] = "設施",
  ["Profession"] = "專業",
  ["Blueprint"] = "藍圖",
  ["Dropped by: {n:250657::Rath'mael} in the Ruins of Lordaeron"] = "掉落自：羅德隆廢墟的 {n:250657::Rath'mael}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:10508::Ras Frostwhisper} in Scholomance"] = "掉落自：通靈學院的 {n:10508::Ras Frostwhisper}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:8983::Golem Lord Argelmach} in Blackrock Depths"] = "掉落自：黑石深淵的 {n:8983::Golem Lord Argelmach}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:261809::Nanaya} in Kalimdor"] = "掉落自：卡林多的 {n:261809::Nanaya}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:11058::Ezra Grimm} in Stratholme"] = "掉落自：斯坦索姆的 {n:11058::Ezra Grimm}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:3886::Razorclaw the Butcher} in Shadowfang Keep"] = "掉落自：影牙城堡的 {n:3886::Razorclaw the Butcher}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:10432::Vectus} in Scholomance"] = "掉落自：通靈學院的 {n:10432::Vectus}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:246017::Unstable Sentinel} in the City of Dalaran"] = "掉落自：達拉然城的 {n:246017::Unstable Sentinel}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:10436::Baroness Anastari} in Stratholme"] = "掉落自：斯坦索姆的 {n:10436::Baroness Anastari}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:9156::Ambassador Flamelash} in Blackrock Depths"] = "掉落自：黑石深淵的 {n:9156::Ambassador Flamelash}",
  ["Dropped by: {n:9736::Quartermaster Zigris} in Lower Blackrock Spire"] = "掉落自：黑石塔下層的 {n:9736::Quartermaster Zigris}",
  ["Merchant's Favor is a new currency in WoW Forever. You get it by filling Waylaid Crates with materials and handing them in at your faction's camp, Durotar Supply and Logistics for Horde and the Azeroth Commerce Authority for Alliance, and you spend it on the recipes, mount, pet, tabard and titles the camp vendors sell. Many recipes and the mount, pet and tabard also need reputation with the camp, which you get from Craftsman's Writs. This WoW Forever Merchant's Favor guide will show you where the camps are, how to earn Merchant's Favor and reputation, and every recipe the vendors sell."] = "商人的青睞是 WoW Forever 中的新貨幣。你可以把材料裝進遭劫貨箱，交到你陣營的營地來取得：部落是杜洛塔補給與物流，聯盟是艾澤拉斯商業管理局。商人的青睞可以用來購買營地商人出售的配方、坐騎、寵物、外袍和頭銜。許多配方以及坐騎、寵物和外袍還需要該營地的聲望，聲望則來自工匠委託書。這份 WoW Forever 商人的青睞指南將告訴你營地在哪裡、如何獲得商人的青睞和聲望，以及商人出售的每一個配方。",
  ["How It Works"] = "運作方式",
  ["Waylaid Crates drop randomly in the open world and in dungeons, and you can also buy them on the Auction House. You fill a crate with the materials it asks for and hand it in at your camp. For that you get Merchant's Favor, the currency you buy the recipes with."] = "遭劫貨箱會在野外和地城中隨機掉落，你也可以在拍賣場購買。把貨箱要求的材料裝進去，然後交到你的營地。這樣你就能獲得商人的青睞，也就是購買配方用的貨幣。",
  ["Many recipes also need reputation with the camp. You earn reputation by doing Craftsman's Writs. You get a writ, craft the item it asks for and bring it to the customer."] = "許多配方還需要該營地的聲望。你可以透過完成工匠委託書來獲得聲望。拿到委託書後，製作它要求的物品並交給顧客。",
  ["Where the Camps Are"] = "營地在哪裡",
  ["The Horde camp belongs to Durotar Supply and Logistics, and the Alliance camp belongs to the Azeroth Commerce Authority. Each camp has a recipe vendor for every crafting profession and Cooking, and both camps sell the same recipes (see Recipes by Profession below)."] = "部落營地屬於杜洛塔補給與物流，聯盟營地屬於艾澤拉斯商業管理局。每個營地都有每種製作專業和烹飪的配方商人，兩個營地出售的配方相同（見下方「各專業配方」）。",
  ["Three Corners, Redridge Mountains"] = "赤脊山，三角路口",
  ["How to Earn Merchant's Favor"] = "如何獲得商人的青睞",
  ["You earn Merchant's Favor by filling Waylaid Crates with materials and bringing them to your camp."] = "把材料裝進遭劫貨箱並帶到你的營地，就能獲得商人的青睞。",
  ["Merchant's Favor is per character, so every character has to earn its own."] = "商人的青睞是以角色計算，所以每個角色都得自己賺。",
  ["Filling a Waylaid Crate"] = "填裝遭劫貨箱",
  ["{b}Find a Waylaid Crate.{/b} They drop randomly in the open world and in dungeons, and {b}you can also buy them on the Auction House{/b}. Each one asks for one kind of material, for example {i:248684:inv_crate_07:Waylaid Crate: Apprentice Textiles}."] = "{b}找到一個遭劫貨箱。{/b}它們會在野外和地城中隨機掉落，{b}你也可以在拍賣場購買{/b}。每個貨箱要求一種材料，例如 {i:248684:inv_crate_07:Waylaid Crate: Apprentice Textiles}。",
  ["Right-click it and fill it with one of the bundles it lists, for example 40 Linen Cloth or 20 Light Leather (see Waylaid Crates and Rewards below). You get a Sealed crate, and that one binds to you."] = "右鍵點擊它，用它列出的其中一組材料填裝，例如 40 亞麻布或 20 輕皮（見下方「遭劫貨箱與獎勵」）。你會得到一個已封裝的貨箱，它會綁定在你身上。",
  ["Bring the Sealed crate to {n:0::Dokimi} at the Horde camp or {n:0::Marcy Baker} at the Alliance camp. You get Merchant's Favor and some silver for it."] = "把已封裝的貨箱交給部落營地的 {n:0::Dokimi} 或聯盟營地的 {n:0::Marcy Baker}。你會獲得商人的青睞和一些銀幣。",
  ["Waylaid Crates and Rewards"] = "遭劫貨箱與獎勵",
  ["When you fill a Waylaid Crate, it turns into a Sealed crate of the same rank and color. You hand that one in at your camp for the Merchant's Favor in the last column. There are also blue Sealed crates and a Sealed Elite Crate, but I don't know yet what they give."] = "填裝遭劫貨箱後，它會變成同等級、同顏色的已封裝貨箱。把它交到你的營地，就能獲得最後一欄列出的商人的青睞。另外還有藍色的已封裝貨箱和已封裝的精英貨箱，但我還不知道它們會給什麼。",
  ["The Textiles, Ore, Herbs and Curiosities crates take raw materials, and the Fabrics, Ingots and Parts crates take crafted ones."] = "紡織品、礦石、草藥和珍奇物品貨箱收的是原始材料，布料、金屬錠和零件貨箱收的是製作出來的材料。",
  ["{b}A crate needs only one of the bundles in its row, not all of them.{/b}"] = "{b}一個貨箱只需要該列中的其中一組材料，不是全部。{/b}",
  ["Apprentice"] = "學徒",
  ["Journeyman"] = "熟手",
  ["Expert"] = "專家",
  ["Artisan"] = "工匠",
  ["You need level 10 to open these."] = "需要等級 10 才能打開這些。",
  ["You also get {m:2:s:} {m:50:c:} for a white crate and {m:5:s:} for a green one."] = "白色貨箱另外還會得到 {m:2:s:} {m:50:c:}，綠色的則是 {m:5:s:}。",
  ["Crate"] = "貨箱",
  ["Fill it with one of these"] = "用以下其中一組填裝",
  ["Reward"] = "獎勵",
  ["You also get {m:5:s:} for a white crate and {m:10:s:} for a green one."] = "白色貨箱另外還會得到 {m:5:s:}，綠色的則是 {m:10:s:}。",
  ["You need level 20 to open these."] = "需要等級 20 才能打開這些。",
  ["You also get {m:7:s:} {m:50:c:} for a white crate and {m:15:s:} for a green one."] = "白色貨箱另外還會得到 {m:7:s:} {m:50:c:}，綠色的則是 {m:15:s:}。",
  ["You need level 35 to open these."] = "需要等級 35 才能打開這些。",
  ["Not known yet"] = "尚不清楚",
  ["How to Earn Durotar Supply and Azeroth Commerce Authority Reputation"] = "如何獲得杜洛塔補給與物流和艾澤拉斯商業管理局的聲望",
  ["{b}Handing in Sealed crates doesn't give reputation.{/b} Reputation with Durotar Supply and Logistics or the Azeroth Commerce Authority comes from Craftsman's Writs, crafting orders that you deliver to a customer somewhere in the world. After reaching Friendly, empty Waylaid Crates give reputation too (see Crate Returns after Friendly below)."] = "{b}交已封裝的貨箱不會給聲望。{/b}杜洛塔補給與物流或艾澤拉斯商業管理局的聲望來自工匠委託書，也就是要交給世界某處顧客的製作訂單。達到友善後，空的遭劫貨箱也能給聲望（見下方「友善後的貨箱回收」）。",
  ["The first time you fill a crate or start a writ, you also get a {i:280180:inv_misc_note_03:Shipping Label}. It starts a quest to your camp, which gives 2,000 reputation and 50 Merchant's Favor."] = "你第一次填裝貨箱或開始委託書時，也會獲得一個 {i:280180:inv_misc_note_03:Shipping Label}。它會開啟一個前往你營地的任務，獎勵 2,000 聲望和 50 商人的青睞。",
  ["Craftsman's Writs"] = "工匠委託書",
  ["A Journeyman writ gives 75 reputation, an Expert writ 125 and an Artisan writ 200. {b}You can do each writ once a day{/b}, and as many different writs a day as you want."] = "熟手委託書給 75 聲望，專家委託書給 125，工匠委託書給 200。{b}每份委託書每天可以做一次{/b}，不同的委託書每天想做幾份都可以。",
  ["{b}Get a Craftsman's Writ.{/b} In the open world and in dungeons they drop as a {i:262888:inv_misc_note_02:Sealed Journeyman's Writ}, {i:262889:inv_misc_note_02:Sealed Expert's Writ} or {i:262890:inv_misc_note_02:Sealed Artisan's Writ}, an envelope with a random writ of that rank inside. {b}You can also buy writs on the Auction House.{/b}"] = "{b}取得一份工匠委託書。{/b}在野外和地城中，它們會以 {i:262888:inv_misc_note_02:Sealed Journeyman's Writ}、{i:262889:inv_misc_note_02:Sealed Expert's Writ} 或 {i:262890:inv_misc_note_02:Sealed Artisan's Writ} 的形式掉落，這是一個裝有該等級隨機委託書的信封。{b}你也可以在拍賣場購買委託書。{/b}",
  ["Right-click the writ to start its quest, for example {i:264047:inv_misc_note_01:Craftsman's Writ: Lesser Wizard's Robe}."] = "右鍵點擊委託書來開始它的任務，例如 {i:264047:inv_misc_note_01:Craftsman's Writ: Lesser Wizard's Robe}。",
  ["Make the item it asks for or buy it on the Auction House. You don't need the profession yourself."] = "製作它要求的物品，或在拍賣場購買。你自己不需要具備該專業。",
  ["Bring the item to the customer, your map shows where. The customer takes the item and the writ, and you get the reputation and a Coin Pouch with some silver. Writs don't give Merchant's Favor. {b}On the beta, the customer had no question mark over their head.{/b} I think it was a bug, so if you don't see one, right-click them anyway and the window to hand in the writ opens."] = "把物品交給顧客，地圖上會顯示位置。顧客會收下物品和委託書，你會獲得聲望和一個裝有一些銀幣的錢袋。委託書不給商人的青睞。{b}在測試版中，顧客頭上沒有問號。{/b}我想那是個錯誤，所以如果你沒看到問號，還是右鍵點擊他們，交付委託書的視窗就會打開。",
  ["Crate Returns after Friendly"] = "友善後的貨箱回收",
  ["At Friendly, you unlock the Uncertified Scribe in your camp, {n:0:horde:Kurvelk Shadowhoof} at the Horde camp and {n:0:alliance:Dianne Softstep} at the Alliance camp. Both sell the same two items:"] = "達到友善時，你會解鎖營地中的無證抄寫員，部落營地是 {n:0:horde:Kurvelk Shadowhoof}，聯盟營地是 {n:0:alliance:Dianne Softstep}。兩者都出售相同的兩種物品：",
  ["Reputation"] = "聲望",
  ["What it does"] = "用途",
  ["Friendly"] = "友善",
  ["Turns an empty Waylaid Crate into 50 reputation, see the steps below."] = "把一個空的遭劫貨箱換成 50 聲望，步驟見下方。",
  ["Honored"] = "尊敬",
  ["Turns a Craftsman's Writ into a random writ of the same rank."] = "把一份工匠委託書換成同等級的隨機委託書。",
  ["{b}Buy a {i:262902:inv_10_inscription2_repcontracts_scroll_02_uprez_color5:Forged Delivery Receipt}{/b} from the Uncertified Scribe."] = "{b}向無證抄寫員購買一張 {i:262902:inv_10_inscription2_repcontracts_scroll_02_uprez_color5:Forged Delivery Receipt}{/b}。",
  ["Buy a Waylaid Crate on the Auction House. The receipt seems to work on any of them, so buy the cheapest one."] = "在拍賣場購買一個遭劫貨箱。收據似乎對任何貨箱都有效，所以買最便宜的就好。",
  ["Use the receipt on the crate. You get a {i:262917:inv_crate_01:Notarized Shipping Container}."] = "對貨箱使用收據。你會得到一個 {i:262917:inv_crate_01:Notarized Shipping Container}。",
  ["Hand the container to the same NPC who takes your Sealed crates. You get the reputation and 1 silver."] = "把貨櫃交給收已封裝貨箱的同一位 NPC。你會獲得聲望和 1 銀幣。",
  ["Recipes by Profession"] = "各專業配方",
  ["Both camps, Durotar Supply and Logistics (Horde) and the Azeroth Commerce Authority (Alliance), sell the same recipes for Merchant's Favor. This is what each profession gets:"] = "兩個營地，杜洛塔補給與物流（部落）和艾澤拉斯商業管理局（聯盟），都用商人的青睞出售相同的配方。以下是各專業可以得到的：",
  ["{b}Alchemy:{/b} potions and elixirs."] = "{b}鍊金術：{/b}藥水和藥劑。",
  ["{b}Blacksmithing:{/b} mail and plate sets for tanks, melee, healers and paladins, and three weapons."] = "{b}鍛造：{/b}給坦克、近戰、治療者和聖騎士的鎖甲與鎧甲套裝，以及三把武器。",
  ["{b}Cooking:{/b} six smoothies that give Spirit."] = "{b}烹飪：{/b}六種提供精神的冰沙。",
  ["{b}Enchanting:{/b} necklace, weapon and armor enchants, relics (idols, totems and librams) and caster weapons (staves, off-hands and wands)."] = "{b}附魔：{/b}項鍊、武器和護甲附魔、聖物（神像、圖騰和聖契）以及施法者武器（法杖、副手和魔杖）。",
  ["{b}Engineering:{/b} bombs, thrown weapons, goggles, belts, trinkets and gadgets."] = "{b}工程學：{/b}炸彈、投擲武器、護目鏡、腰帶、飾品和小工具。",
  ["{b}Leatherworking:{/b} leather and mail sets for every role, and two armor kits."] = "{b}製皮：{/b}適合各種角色的皮甲與鎖甲套裝，以及兩種護甲片。",
  ["{b}Tailoring:{/b} cloth sets for every spell school and for healers, and two reagent bags."] = "{b}裁縫：{/b}適合各法術系別和治療者的布甲套裝，以及兩種材料包。",
  ["{b}The armor and weapons you craft from these recipes bind on pickup{/b}, so you can only make them for yourself."] = "{b}用這些配方製作的護甲和武器是拾取綁定{/b}，所以你只能做給自己用。",
  ["{n:0:horde:Apothecary Durelle} at the Horde camp and {n:0:alliance:Nina Surefire} at the Alliance camp sell 28 Alchemy recipes."] = "部落營地的 {n:0:horde:Apothecary Durelle} 和聯盟營地的 {n:0:alliance:Nina Surefire} 出售 28 個鍊金術配方。",
