  ["Thrown, a cloud for 12 sec that deals 31-36 Nature damage every second to enemies in it"] = "投擲後產生持續 12 秒的雲霧，每秒對其中的敵人造成 31-36 點自然傷害",
  ["10 doses for 20 sec. When you take Bleed damage, a dose moves to a nearby enemy and deals 325 Nature damage when it ends"] = "10 層，持續 20 秒。你受到流血傷害時，一層會轉移到附近的敵人身上，並在結束時造成 325 點自然傷害",
